  "scope": "Read-only fresh-FDT-bound GPIO32 observer. Bank1 offsets and GPIO/RIO/PAD semantics come from the pinned driver, whose generic pin accessor applies them to GPIO32. Public RP1 PDF marks IO_BANK1/2 internal; its bank0 status table is a supporting raw-register reference, not independent bank1 ownership or electrical proof. No GPIO writes, reset pulse, MDIO commands, power/refclock measurement, packet/DMA/IRQ claim. Linux toggles this board-declared active-low reset for5ms before its PHY probe; our missing standalone reset setup is a plausible prerequisite, not a proven cause of the preserved all-FFFF trial."
